<title>FINLAND: Orion Jan-April net sales by division.</title>
<headline>Orion Jan-April net sales by division.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish pharmaceuticals group Orion-Yhtyma Oy on Wednesday gave the following breakdown of its January-April net sales by division (million markka):</p>
<p>				Jan-April '97	 Jan-April '96</p>
<p> Orion Pharma total	  782		     755</p>
<p>  domestic		     420		     419</p>
<p>  overseas operations	362		     336</p>
<p> Oriola			  498		     477</p>
<p> Orion Diagnostica	    67			67</p>
<p> Noiro			   185		     166</p>
<p> Normet			   71			60</p>
<p> TOTAL			 1,569		   1,490</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0240, news@Reuters.fi</p>
</text>
